<title>USA: Coastal Corp completes $400 mln debt offer.</title>
<headline>Coastal Corp completes $400 mln debt offer.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Corp said on Monday that it has completed a $400 million offering of debt securities.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to refinance certain high-cost debt and retire bank borrowings, Coastal said.</p>
<p>The company said it sold $200 milion in principal of 30-year 6.7 percent senior debentures due February 15, 2027 and $200 million in principal of 40-year 7.42 percent senior debentures due February 15, 2037.</p>
</text>
